# Fixed defect 2438, 2026-11-10, lane b30-pkg, a shape beside it: `use
# <core>`, `core` an entry whose tree is not placed. No tree is there to
# list, so the line is told how it goes on and no module is named: the
# compiler reads no index (panel 235's R9), and a name it cannot read is one
# it would invent.
use <core>  #~ package_wants_a_module

function main()
    print("x")
